cff-version: 1.2.0
message: >-
  EvLink was accepted to the EMNLP 2026 Main Conference. If you use EvLink,
  please cite this software; the final proceedings citation will be added after
  camera-ready publication.
title: "EvLink: Source-grounded Evidence Linking for Graph RAG"
type: software
authors:
  - given-names: "Linyao"
    family-names: "Zheng"
  - given-names: "Xuhang"
